{
  "feature": "Find a deck read, UI-2 and UI-3: the view inside card details, the band, the read's rows, the fold, stored reads out of date, plan sources and the About entry",
  "note": "Needs a server with SWAP_TOOLS_ENABLED and FIND_A_DECK_READ_ENABLED 'true', FITS_READ_STUB unset (the stub's picks) and FITS_READ_STUB_DELAY_MS about 2500 so the running band can be photographed, signed in as an account on a scratch branch with credits in hand. READ_CARD is a card that account owns, Commander-legal, that several of its decks can take and no read has been stored for yet (The Eternal Wanderer, 20a1671d-e8a4-4cf1-87a7-f2f6319f4b9e, on the 2026-10-12 scratch copy). OFFER_CARD is a second such card with no stored read (Sun Titan, b2e950fb-cb7e-40a0-a311-5bbdd0477b29): P1 and P2 open it, and P2's press stores its read, so the next run needs another. READ_CARD holds a stored read for P3 and P3a. UI-3 rows: STALE_CARD holds a stored read one of whose decks has been edited since (the 2026-10-12 scratch copy: The Eternal Wanderer after four cards were added to HD Tune - Scrappy Survivors).",
